# Works showcase GIFs: the site plays the .mp4 loops instead (same visual,
# ~1/3 the bytes). The GIFs are deck/social deliverables and live in Drive
# under works-showcase-2026-07, so they stay out of the deployed bundle.
public/works/*.gif
